@startuml Sprint 7 - Provider Order ID Bug
!theme plain
title <font size=24 color="#C62828"><b>Sprint 7: Provider Order ID Mismatch Bug</b></font>\n<font size=14 color="#E53935">Why OXPAID is never updated</font>

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontColor #000000

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #333333
    LifeLineBorderColor #666666
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #E3F2FD
    ParticipantBorderColor #1565C0
}

actor Customer as C
participant "Stripe\nCheckout" as SC #BBDEFB
participant "StripeCheckout\nSessionHandler" as SCSH #C8E6C9
participant "Contract\nRepository" as CR #FFF9C4
participant "StripeCheckout\nReturnHandler" as SCRH #C8E6C9
participant "PaymentAuthorized\nEventHandler" as PAEH #C8E6C9
participant "Webhook\nController" as WC #FFCDD2
participant "WebhookContract\nFulfillmentHandler" as WCFH #FFCDD2

== Checkout Flow ==

C -> SC : Pay
SC -> SCSH : Create session
SCSH -> CR : <font color="#2E7D32">Save contract with\n<b>providerOrderId = cs_test_...</b></font>
note right #C8E6C9
  Contract stores
  Checkout Session ID
end note

SC --> C : Payment success
C -> SCRH : Return to shop

== Return Handler (BUG HERE!) ==

SCRH -> SCRH : Get paymentIntentId (pi_...)
SCRH -> SCRH : Get sessionId (cs_test_...)

SCRH -> PAEH : <font color="#C62828"><b>PaymentAuthorizedEvent(\n  providerOrderId = sessionId  // BUG!\n)</b></font>
note right #FFCDD2
  <font color="#C62828"><b>BUG:</b></font>
  Should pass paymentIntentId
  but passes sessionId instead!
end note

PAEH -> CR : <font color="#C62828">contract.setProvider("stripe", cs_test_...)</font>
note right #FFCDD2
  Contract KEEPS
  cs_test_... as providerOrderId
  instead of pi_...
end note

== Webhook Arrives (FAILS!) ==

WC -> WCFH : handlePaymentSucceeded(<font color="#1565C0"><b>pi_...</b></font>)
WCFH -> CR : findByProviderOrderId(<font color="#1565C0"><b>pi_...</b></font>)
CR --> WCFH : <font color="#C62828"><b>null</b></font> (not found!)
note right #FFCDD2
  Lookup FAILS because:
  Contract has: cs_test_...
  Webhook has: pi_...
end note

WCFH --> WC : <font color="#C62828">null (contract not found)</font>
WC -> WC : Fall back to legacy path
WC -> WC : <font color="#C62828">Legacy also fails...</font>
note right #FFCDD2
  <font color="#C62828"><b>RESULT:</b></font>
  - Contract stays COMMITTED
  - OXPAID = 0000-00-00 00:00:00
  - E2E tests fail!
end note

legend bottom
  |= Component |= ID Type |= Value |
  | Contract (stored) | Checkout Session | <font color="#C62828">cs_test_...</font> |
  | Webhook (received) | PaymentIntent | <font color="#1565C0">pi_...</font> |
  | <font color="#C62828"><b>MISMATCH!</b></font> | | |
endlegend

@enduml
